<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Allyson Votruba | Resume</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f5f7fa;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a90e2, #6a11cb);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 36px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #333;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            margin: 0 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        section {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h2 {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            color: #333;
        }

        h3 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        ul {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #333;
            color: white;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Allyson Votruba</h1>
    <p>allysonvotruba@iCloud.com</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#experience">Experience</a>
    <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
    <a href="#education">Education</a>
</nav>

<section id="experience">
    <h2>Work Experience</h2>

    <h3>Snow Cone Stand Worker</h3>
    <p><em>Seasonal Position</em></p>
    <ul>
        <li>Served customers in a fast-paced environment</li>
        <li>Handled cash transactions and provided accurate change</li>
        <li>Maintained cleanliness and organization of workspace</li>
        <li>Developed strong customer service and communication skills</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Golf Course Employee</h3>
    <p><em>Part-Time Position</em></p>
    <ul>
        <li>Assisted customers and ensured a positive guest experience</li>
        <li>Maintained course areas and facilities</li>
        <li>Worked as part of a team to complete daily tasks efficiently</li>
        <li>Demonstrated responsibility and reliability</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="skills">
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Strong Communication</li>
        <li>Customer Service</li>
        <li>Teamwork</li>
        <li>Time Management</li>
        <li>Problem Solving</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="education">
    <h2>Education</h2>
    <h3>College Student</h3>
    <p>Sophomore</p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Allyson Votruba</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
